  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LK North and East Pilot WASH for Post-Conflict Resettle (NEP WASH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development objective is to increase accessibility to safe and sustainable pipe borne water supply and sanitation to complement post-conflict housing reconstruction interventions in a selected number of rural communities within two districts of the northern and eastern provinces of Sri Lanka. In doing so, the project will also pilot viable mechanisms to strengthen institutional systems to deliver local level WASH services, eventually generating lessons and replicable  models to contribute to the overall improvement of hygiene practices and to the overall quality of life of communities of returnees.</narrative>
  </description>
